ga (di perbatasan negerimu) dan bertakwalah kepada Allah, supaya kamu beruntung.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "يَٰٓأَيُّهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱصْبِرُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَصَابِرُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَرَابِطُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱتَّقُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَعَلَّكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُفْلِحُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/13eb59fe141ace876ff7.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "you (all) succeed", "bs": "uspijevate", "tr": "başarırsınız", "fr": "vous réussissez", "id": "kalian berhasil", "ur": "تم کامیاب ہوتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা সফল হও", "fa": "موفق می‌شوید"}}]}, {"ref": "10:77", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1441.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Moses said: Speak ye (so) of the Truth when it hath come unto you? Is this magic? Now magicians thrive not.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Musa dedi ki, \"Size hak gelince, ona böyle mi diyorsunuz? Bu sihir midir?\" Halbuki sihirbazlar iflah olmazlar.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "موسیٰ نے کہا کیا حق کی نسبت ایسا کہتے ہو جب وہ تمہارے پاس آیا کیا یہ جادو ہے اور جادوگر مراد کو نہیں پہنچتے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Musa berkata: \"Apakah kamu mengatakan terhadap kebenaran waktu ia datang kepadamu, sihirkah ini?\" padahal ahli-ahli sihir itu tidaklah mendapat kemenangan\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُوسَىٰٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَتَقُولُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لِلْحَقِّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَمَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "جَآءَكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَسِحْرٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هَٰذَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُفْلِحُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/27777b44ede2e655c1c7.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "he/it succeeds", "bs": "uspijeva", "tr": "başarır", "fr": "il réussit", "id": "dia berhasil", "ur": "وہ کامیاب ہوتا ہے", "bn": "সে সফল হয়", "fa": "موفق می‌شود"}}, {"text": "ٱلسَّٰحِرُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "23:1", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2674.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Successful indeed are the believers", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Gerçekten müminler kurtuluşa ermiştir,", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "بیشک مراد کو پہنچے ایمان والے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Sesungguhnya beruntunglah orang-orang yang beriman,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قَدْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَفْلَحَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/af20e16c1637749a7f15.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "uspjeli su", "en": "has succeeded", "tr": "kurtuluşa erdiler", "fr": "a réussi", "id": "telah beruntung", "ur": "کامیاب ہو گیا", "bn": "সফল হয়েছে", "fa": "رستگار شده است"}}, {"text": "ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "10:69", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1433.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Say: Verily those who invent a lie concerning Allah will not succeed.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "De ki: Allah'a iftira edenler elbette felah bulmazlar.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تم فرماؤ وہ جو اللہ پر جھوٹ باندھتے ہیں ان کا بھلا نہ ہوگا،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Katakanlah: \"Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang mengada-adakan kebohongan terhadap Allah tidak beruntung\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قُلْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَفْتَرُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلَى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْكَذِبَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُفْلِحُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/b7de3c5370f495457e8c.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "uspijevaju", "en": "they succeed", "tr": "kurtuluşa ererler", "fr": "ils réussissent", "id": "mereka beruntung", "ur": "وہ کامیاب ہوتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা সফল হয়", "fa": "رستگار می‌شوند"}}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "تُفْلِحُونَ", "count": 11, "first": "2:189", "audio": "audio/143593dd168aea2e8bba.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "you (all) succeed", "bs": "uspijevate", "tr": "başarırsınız", "fr": "vous réussissez", "id": "kalian berhasil", "ur": "تم کامیاب ہوتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা সফল হও", "fa": "موفق می‌شوید"}}, {"arabic"